---
// Design exploration — Direction 3: "Shifting Environments"
// Grade Hub / curriculum-browsing environment.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
    <title>2nd Grade Spelling Words (Design exploration)</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,560;0,9..144,650&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="proto-badge" aria-hidden="true">Design exploration — Shifting Environments</div>

    <div class="env-hub">
      <header class="topline">
        <a class="wordmark" href="/design-explore/shifting-environments/">
          <span class="wordmark-mark">sw</span>spellingwords
        </a>
        <nav class="topnav" aria-label="Prototype navigation">
          <a href="/design-explore/shifting-environments/">Home</a>
          <a href="/design-explore/shifting-environments/skill">Skill page</a>
          <a href="/design-explore/shifting-environments/practice">Practice</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main>
        <p class="crumb"><a href="/design-explore/shifting-environments/">Grades</a> / 2nd Grade</p>
        <h1>2nd Grade Spelling Words</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Second grade spelling widens out from single-syllable basics into compound words,
          longer high-frequency sight words, and the first themed units. Below, the words are
          grouped the way a 2nd grade classroom actually teaches them &mdash; by pattern first, by
          topic second.
        </p>

        <section class="strand" aria-labelledby="strand-1-h">
          <div class="strand-tab" style="--tab: #1f5c4e;"><span>01</span></div>
          <div class="strand-body">
            <p class="strand-kicker">Core Spelling</p>
            <h2 id="strand-1-h">Compound Words</h2>
            <p>
              Two small words joined into one, like <em>backpack</em> and <em>sunshine</em>.
              This unit is where most 2nd graders start noticing spelling patterns instead of
              memorizing words one at a time.
            </p>
            <a class="unit-link" href="/design-explore/shifting-environments/skill">Open unit &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="strand" aria-labelledby="strand-2-h">
          <div class="strand-tab" style="--tab: #a9631f;"><span>02</span></div>
          <div class="strand-body">
            <p class="strand-kicker">High-Frequency Words</p>
            <h2 id="strand-2-h">Grade 1 High-Frequency Words, Set 1</h2>
            <p>
              A review set carried forward from 1st grade &mdash; words like <em>because</em>,
              <em>people</em>, and <em>friend</em> that show up constantly in reading but don&rsquo;t
              follow tidy phonics rules.
            </p>
            <a class="unit-link" href="/design-explore/shifting-environments/skill">Open unit &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="strand" aria-labelledby="strand-3-h">
          <div class="strand-tab" style="--tab: #395b8c;"><span>03</span></div>
          <div class="strand-body">
            <p class="strand-kicker">Themed Spelling Practice</p>
            <h2 id="strand-3-h">Weather &amp; Seasons Words</h2>
            <p>
              A vocabulary-building unit that pairs spelling with science and seasons talk &mdash;
              <em>cloudy</em>, <em>thunder</em>, <em>autumn</em>, <em>freezing</em> &mdash; useful
              alongside a classroom weather unit.
            </p>
            <a class="unit-link" href="/design-explore/shifting-environments/skill">Open unit &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="callout" aria-labelledby="begin-h">
          <p class="callout-eyebrow">New to this grade?</p>
          <h2 id="begin-h">Where to begin</h2>
          <p>
            Start with <strong>Compound Words</strong> &mdash; it&rsquo;s the shortest unit, it
            builds directly on 1st grade skills, and it gives kids an early, visible win before
            moving into sight words.
          </p>
          <a class="callout-cta" href="/design-explore/shifting-environments/skill">Start with Compound Words &rarr;</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="grade-nav" aria-label="Other grades">
          <a href="/design-explore/shifting-environments/grade-hub" class="grade-nav-prev">
            <span class="grade-nav-dir">&larr; Previous</span>
            <span class="grade-nav-name">1st Grade</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/design-explore/shifting-environments/grade-hub" class="grade-nav-next">
            <span class="grade-nav-dir">Next &rarr;</span>
            <span class="grade-nav-name">3rd Grade</span>
          </a>
        </nav>
      </main>
    </div>

    <style>
      :global(html, body) {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .proto-badge {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 10px;
        right: 10px;
        z-index: 50;
        background: rgba(15, 32, 27, 0.82);
        color: #eafdf5;
        font: 500 11px/1.4 'Inter', sans-serif;
        padding: 6px 10px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .env-hub {
        --env-a: #dff0e8;
        --env-b: #eef8f2;
        --ink: #16302a;
        --ink-soft: #3f6157;
        --ink-faint: #6f8c83;
        --accent: #1f5c4e;
        --plate: #f6fcf9;
        --focus-ring: #1c4f8c;

        min-height: 100vh;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--env-b) 0%, var(--env-a) 100%);
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
        color: var(--ink);
        padding: 0 clamp(20px, 5vw, 64px) 96px;
      }
      a {
        color: inherit;
      }
      *:focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid var(--focus-ring);
        outline-offset: 3px;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }

      .topline {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 28px 0 8px;
        max-width: 880px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .wordmark {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-weight: 650;
        font-size: 20px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      .wordmark-mark {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
        border-radius: 9px;
        background: var(--accent);
        color: #fff;
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .topnav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 22px;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .topnav a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
      }
      .topnav a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      main {
        max-width: 880px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .crumb {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--ink-faint);
        margin: 40px 0 10px;
      }
      .crumb a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--ink-faint);
      }
      .crumb a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      h1 {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-weight: 650;
        font-size: clamp(30px, 4.4vw, 42px);
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }
      .lede {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        max-width: 68ch;
        margin: 0 0 44px;
      }

      /* Curriculum "notebook spread": each strand is a nearly-flush panel
         with a colored index tab, differentiated by a hairline top edge
         rather than a drop shadow — deliberately low elevation, because
         this is a browsing list, not a highlighted object. */
      .strand {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 64px 1fr;
        background: var(--plate);
        border-radius: 4px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) inset;
        border: 1px solid rgba(22, 48, 42, 0.08);
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .strand-tab {
        background: var(--tab);
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        justify-content: center;
        padding-top: 22px;
      }
      .strand-tab span {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 600;
        writing-mode: vertical-rl;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      }
      .strand-body {
        padding: 22px 26px 24px;
      }
      .strand-kicker {
        margin: 0 0 6px;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--ink-faint);
      }
      .strand-body h2 {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-weight: 560;
        font-size: 21px;
        margin: 0 0 8px;
      }
      .strand-body p:not(.strand-kicker) {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        max-width: 62ch;
      }
      .unit-link {
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--accent);
        border-bottom: 1.5px solid transparent;
      }
      .unit-link:hover {
        border-color: var(--accent);
      }

      /* The one moment on this page that DOES lift decisively: an
         attention callout, rendered like a clipped index card set at a
         slight angle against the notebook spread. */
      .callout {
        position: relative;
        background: #fff9ec;
        border: 1px solid rgba(169, 99, 31, 0.28);
        border-radius: 3px 16px 3px 16px;
        padding: 26px 30px 28px;
        margin: 40px 0 52px;
        transform: rotate(-0.6deg);
        box-shadow: 0 18px 34px -20px rgba(22, 48, 42, 0.35);
        max-width: 620px;
      }
      .callout::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        right: 0;
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 50%, rgba(169, 99, 31, 0.18) 50%);
        border-radius: 0 3px 0 0;
      }
      .callout-eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 4px;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #a9631f;
      }
      .callout h2 {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-weight: 560;
        font-size: 20px;
        margin: 0 0 10px;
      }
      .callout p {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
      }
      .callout-cta {
        display: inline-block;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #fff;
        background: #a9631f;
        padding: 10px 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
      }
      .callout-cta:hover {
        background: #874e18;
      }

      .grade-nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(22, 48, 42, 0.14);
        padding-top: 22px;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .grade-nav a {
        text-decoration: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 3px;
      }
      .grade-nav-next {
        text-align: right;
      }
      .grade-nav-dir {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: var(--ink-faint);
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .grade-nav-name {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-weight: 560;
        font-size: 17px;
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      .grade-nav a:hover .grade-nav-name {
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        .strand {
          grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr;
        }
        .strand-body {
          padding: 18px 18px 20px;
        }
        .callout {
          transform: none;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
